@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Resumefolio | Shared-profile update review
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #1C3453
 BorderColor #9FB2CD
 FontColor #F1F5F9
 DiamondBackgroundColor #49351C
 DiamondBorderColor #F2BA72
 StartColor #F1F5F9
 EndColor #F1F5F9
}
start
:Identify authorized source change and affected resume contexts;
if (Propagation policy defined for this change?) then (yes)
 :Evaluate each affected selection / field under that policy;
 if (Content omitted from this resume?) then (yes)
  :Preserve deliberate omission; <<#173B34>>
 else (selected)
  if (Resume-specific override applies?) then (yes)
   :Preserve override under defined precedence rules; <<#173B34>>
  else (no override)
   :Apply only the agreed linked-content update behavior;
  endif
 endif
 :Handle user review / conflicts under the explicit update policy;
 :Apply separate save / publication / PDF revision rules;
else (pending)
 :Record unresolved propagation decision and affected gate; <<#49351C>>
endif
:Do not overwrite actual submitted copies through later source changes;
stop
legend bottom
Conceptual decision flow, not an automatic propagation implementation.
Evaluate affected fields/selections individually; no update trigger selected.
Independent resume layouts and other resumes' overrides remain protected.
endlegend
@enduml
